  "basis": "The y-axis is inverted, with 0 at the top and 8000 at the bottom. The blue line descends from near 0 on Feb 24 to below 8000 on Mar 14. On this scale, a visual descent corresponds to a numerical increase in the 'Count' of hospitalized patients. The slope steepens significantly in the final third of the period (post-Mar 7), indicating a rapid increase in inpatient demand. This trend aligns with the criteria for surge-capacity planning.",
